{"id": "EUVD-2026-104289", "enisaUuid": "734f60a9-2af9-3750-8ea3-c314e8c43510", "description": "libaribcaption 1.1.0 through 1.1.2 contains a global out-of-bounds read in DecoderImpl::HandleGLGR() that reads past the 78-entry kLatinSpecialTable without an upper bound check. Attackers can supply crafted captions designating the Latin special set with ESC 28 4C followed by bytes 0x6F-0x7E to leak adjacent read-only data or crash decoding.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T13:55:28", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T17:55:16", "baseScore": 4.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haindpwn/libaribcaption-latin-special-table-oob-read", "https://github.com/xqq/libaribcaption/blob/v1.1.2/src/decoder/decoder_impl.cpp", "https://github.com/xqq/libaribcaption/blob/v1.1.2/src/decoder/b24_conv_tables.hpp", "https://github.com/xqq/libaribcaption/commit/9917cb311c93d884cb820d122911a211042da26c", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libaribcaption-1.1.0-through-1.1.2-out-of-bounds-read-via-decoderimpl-handleglgr"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112284", "GHSA-jjwq-w2jx-jw8v"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4b9f47f8-e460-338c-8708-06dbeca732b8", "product": {"name": "libaribcaption", "vendor": {"name": "xqq"}}, "product_version": "1.1.0 \u22641.1.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "443610fd-8c2e-359e-aa3c-294181ddeaff", "vendor": {"name": "xqq"}}], "isExploited": false}